---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Services - Finckia - Développement SaaS en Django avec IA">
  <!-- Hero Section avec fond sombre -->
  <section class="relative bg-gray-900 overflow-hidden py-32">
    <!-- Particules animées en arrière-plan -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-20 left-10 w-2 h-2 bg-primary-400 rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
      <div class="absolute top-40 right-20 w-1 h-1 bg-primary-300 rounded-full animate-ping"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-20 left-1/4 w-3 h-3 bg-primary-500 rounded-full animate-bounce"></div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Gradient animé -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-primary-900 animate-gradient"></div>
    
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 animate-fade-in">
          Mes <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-400 to-primary-600 animate-gradient-text">Services</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 max-w-4xl mx-auto animate-fade-in-delay">
          Développement de logiciels SaaS innovants en Django et solutions d'IA pour les entreprises. 
          Je crée des applications web performantes et intelligentes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services Grid avec design sombre -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-gray-800 relative">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-800 to-gray-900"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        <!-- Développement SaaS en Django -->
        <div class="bg-gray-700/50 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl border border-gray-600/30 p-8 hover:bg-gray-700/70 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-primary-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Logiciels SaaS en Django</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">
            Création d'applications SaaS innovantes et performantes développées avec Django. 
            Je conçois des solutions web robustes et évolutives parfaitement adaptées à vos besoins.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 mt-0.5 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-300">Architecture Django robuste</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 mt-0.5 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-300">Interfaces utilisateur modernes</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 mt-0.5 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-300">API RESTful et GraphQL</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 mt-0.5 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-300">Sécurité et conformité</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Solutions d'IA -->
        <div class="bg-gray-700/50 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl border border-gray-600/30 p-8 hover:bg-gray-700/70 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-primary-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Solutions d'IA</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">
            Intégration d'intelligence artificielle pour automatiser et optimiser vos processus métier. 
            Je développe des solutions IA personnalisées qui s'adaptent à votre secteur d'activité.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 mt-0.5 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-300">Machine Learning personnalisé</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 mt-0.5 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-300">Traitement du langage naturel</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 mt-0.5 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-300">Vision par ordinateur</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 mt-0.5 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-300">Automatisation intelligente</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section avec design sombre -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-900 to-primary-800 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-900/50 to-primary-800/50"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/20"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
        Prêt à créer votre <span class="text-primary-300">application Django</span> ?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-primary-100 mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Contactez-moi pour discuter de votre projet et créer ensemble une application SaaS innovante 
        avec Django et des solutions d'IA.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="bg-white text-primary-600 hover:bg-gray-100 px-12 py-6 rounded-xl text-xl font-semibold transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105 shadow-2xl hover:shadow-white/20"
      >
        Démarrer le projet
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  @keyframes gradient {
    0%, 100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
  }
  
  @keyframes fade-in {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  
  @keyframes gradient-text {
    0%, 100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
  }
  
  .animate-gradient {
    background-size: 400% 400%;
    animation: gradient 15s ease infinite;
  }
  
  .animate-fade-in {
    animation: fade-in 1s ease-out;
  }
  
  .animate-fade-in-delay {
    animation: fade-in 1s ease-out 0.3s both;
  }
  
  .animate-gradient-text {
    background-size: 200% 200%;
    animation: gradient-text 3s ease infinite;
  }
</style>
